    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72487.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Tonight, the deadly heat dome tightening its grip, fueling fires in California and making history in the Southwest. Phoenix, a day away from smashing a 47 year old record. Tonight marking 18 straight days with highs 110 plus with scorching temps expected through the week, straining the city's essential services, firefighters going from call to call.",
