      },
      {
        "text": "Some jobs filled by immigrants are not seasonal but long-term.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Now is an opportunity to solve the immigration problem.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Most immigrants enter the U.S. for economic reasons, not asylum-related ones.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
