    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "And Representative Gonzalez, why does the U.S. sort of hire, I would say, a smaller number of workers sort of for our size, because I think we have similar numbers to Canada and we're a much bigger country when it comes to the type of labor you're talking about.",
