      },
      {
        "text": "The notion that issuing temporary work permits to individuals seeking legal entry to work in the U.S. would take away opportunities from Americans is fear-mongering.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "That notion is a false narrative.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
