    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72487.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 74,
    "turn_text": "Congressman Gonzalez, you've sometimes butted heads with members of your own party, the Republican Party. You were censured by the Texas Republican Party. You think your fellow GOP congressmen and those senators are going to support this bill?",
