    "turn_text": "Manchin publicly joining the organization No Labels in New Hampshire today. The group is launching a massive $70 million effort to create a third-party presidential campaign, a bipartisan ticket with a Democrat and a Republican joining forces. Former Utah Governor, Republican John Huntsman, also hit the road with the group today.",
