    "turn_idx": 118,
    "turn_text": "All right, Vaughn Hill, your joins us now from Manchester, New Hampshire. Vaughn, I want to pick up where you left off there. I don't really understand with some of these third party groups, right? They don't want to be spoilers, but are they putting up candidates or not? If not, then what's the point?",
