    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72487.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 130,
    "turn_text": "Amicia, you know, the most we've heard sort of from the Biden re-elect team is the Bidenomics, right? And they're sort of gonna be running on this economy message. They've sort of stayed out of the fray when it's come to the Republicans, letting them fight amongst themselves. You think that's gonna be the strategy throughout the Republican primary process?",
