    "turn_text": "Matt, I've known you for a long time. I have heard that you think a third party will eventually emerge, a third party candidate. You had a group yourself. It was country over party. I believe it's the name of it. And Matt, but I do want to ask you, it sounds like every time people talk about a third party, it's usually in between elections. And then when an election comes up, everyone says, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no. Because if this person runs, it's going to hurt the Democrats, if that person runs, it's going to hurt the Republicans. It's happened in times before. Where do you stand right now?",
